<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: The Reminder
</h4>

<p>
Scene II: Backstory. Grainy footage. Too dark and jerky to make out particulars. Alien screams -- aaaarg! baaaheakaaaa! -- are jarring. A man in a white lab coat appears. The camera catches him from behind, injecting something into the hind quarters of a goat. Seconds pass. ... Goat horns flail. A great roar envelopes the room. Blood spatters the lens. <br />
<br />
Fade out, with a voiceover:<br />
<br />
Male voice #1: Oh my god. What the hell happened in here?<br />
<br />
There are squishy sounds, footsteps.<br />
<br />
Female voice #1: It was the goats, Mr. Secretary. (With a trembling voice) Those *^#$!&amp; goats. <br />
<br />
Male voice #1: I'd better call the president.
</p>
